{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222030","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1522203001:1":{"text":"이러시면 안 돼요... 저희보다 훨씬 잘 살면서, 왜 굶어 죽게 생긴 사람들의 구호 식량까지 빼앗으려는 거죠?","source_cn":"你们不能这样……你们的生活已经比很多人都好了，为什么还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC81E3EA12DDA984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522203002:0":{"text":"이건 전혀... 콜록, 콜록! 공평하지 않아요...","source_cn":"这根本……咳咳！不公平……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA04A130D9F7E0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522203003:0":{"text":"웬 공평 타령이야? 너희가 가난한 게 내 잘못은 아니잖아!","source_cn":"有什么公不公平的？你们没钱又不是我的错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4535D3BAAB479176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522203004:1":{"text":"흉년이 이렇게 길었는데 우리라고 뭐 넉넉할 거 같아? 지금 보칼리스에 그런 사람이 어디 있어?","source_cn":"饥荒这么久，你们没东西，难道我们就有吗？整个呼临城谁没受灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE2DE0500CB9EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522203005:0":{"text":"하지만... 콜록... 당신들은 먹을 게 부족하진 않잖아요. 돈으로 살 수 있으니까...!","source_cn":"但是你们……咳……你们不缺粮食！你们有钱买啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EC32567D46E6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522203006:0":{"text":"돈으로 살 수 있다고? 보칼리스와 고원 전체가 가뭄으로 난리라 우리 집 농사도 망했어! 빚만 잔뜩인데 돈이 어디 있다는 거야?","source_cn":"谁说我有钱了？呼临城和整片高原都干旱，我家的农田一点收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182EADFA89F3AC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522203007:0":{"text":"눈이 있으면 네가 입은 옷이랑 우리 꼴을 좀 비교해 봐!","source_cn":"你看看你穿的是什么，我们穿的是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85CB9E5EE0C76418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522203008:0":{"text":"네가 돈이 없다고? 그럼 나는...","source_cn":"要是你还没钱，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5D235F1A245893B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522203009:0":{"text":"...그만 싸워라! 다들 조용히 해!","source_cn":"——吵什么吵！都给我闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417A5D78313DC653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522203010:0":{"text":"칼리안, 이게 어떻게 된 일이지?","source_cn":"卡利安，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE7E5554E66344E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522203011:0":{"text":"보고드립니다, 부관님. 그게... 누가 새치기를 해서 다들 불만이...","source_cn":"报告副将，是……是有人插队，其他人有所不满……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B86F4F6EA3518E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522203012:0":{"text":"한심한 놈! 고작 구호 식량 배급 하나 제대로 못 하다니. 10장짜리 시말서를 써서 내일 당장 제출하도록!","source_cn":"丢人现眼的蠢货，发放赈灾粮这点差事你都干不好，回去写十...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2A1E6698136023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522203013:0":{"text":"그리고 너희들은... 전부 제대로 줄 서도록. 계속 싸우면 구호 식량은 없는 줄 알아!","source_cn":"至于你们，全都给我站成一列，不许争抢，不然粮食不予发放！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB907A02F563F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522203014:1":{"text":"지금은 새치기가 문제가 아니라고. 저런 부자들이 왜 구호 식량을 받아가냔 말이야!","source_cn":"现在已经不是插队的问题了！是他这种有钱人凭什么来领赈灾粮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EF874F488978D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522203015:0":{"text":"그쪽이 부관이야? <style=\"highlight\">페르세우스 지휘관의 부관</style>이란 말이지? 어떻게 좀 해봐!","source_cn":"你是副将？<style=highlight>珀尔修斯统...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D874ABAD0A8900A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1522203016:0":{"text":"뭐 어떻게 해달라는 거지? 설마 구호 식량을 전부 너희 집에 갖다 달라는 말은 아니겠지?","source_cn":"还要怎么给你们做主？难不成要把所有赈灾粮都运到你家里去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x350AA42C69128525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522203017:0":{"text":"너...!","source_cn":"你——！<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC886CB768652C962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1522203018:0":{"text":"부관님이 하신 말 못 들었어? 당장 줄 서지 않으면 식량이 없다잖아.","source_cn":"没听到副将刚才说的吗？赶紧排好队，要不然就没粮食了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ED0AD3C5417943D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1522203019:0":{"text":"이런 개... 식량을 못 받아도 오늘 너는 내가 제대로 손 봐줘야겠다!","source_cn":"你这个混蛋……我今天不要粮食了，就要打你一顿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD9E75D43DF61F58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼姆":{"text":"니무","source":"尼姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊阿宋":{"text":"이아손","source":"伊阿宋","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西蒙":{"text":"사이먼","source":"西蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:副将隆尔":{"text":"부관 로르","source":"副将隆尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:士兵卡利安":{"text":"병사 칼리안","source":"士兵卡利安","status":"matched_d